----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 1

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

set b = 5

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

let c = b == 5

----------
expect all three units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 5 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 3 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = true |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

var b = 2

----------
expect unit 1 is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `b` = 5 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | reruns | rerun: overwrites `b` from unit 1, which reran | - |
| 3 | reads `b` (1) | untouched | `b` is 5 after unit 2, as before | `c` = true |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

var b: u32 = 2

----------
expect unit 1 is edited so `b` is a `u32`
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `b` = 5 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | recompiles, runs | writes a `u32` now | - |
| 3 | reads `b` (1) | recompiles, runs | reads `b` after unit 2, which writes a `u32` now | `c` = true |

----------
scriptunit-edit 1
----------

let b: u32 = 2

----------
expect unit 1 is edited so `b` cannot be written
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `b` = 2 |
| 2 | overwrites `b` (1) | recompile fails | `b` is not a `var` | - |
| 3 | reads `b` (1) | recompiles, runs | reads `b` after unit 2, which no longer overwrites it | `c` = false |
